{"hw":"ἐλεέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐλεέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐλε-έω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">impf.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠλέουν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Apollod.Com.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.1</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠλέησα</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ep.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐλέησα</span> (v. infr.):—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἠλέημαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">595.2</span> </span>: (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἔλεος</span>):—<b class=\"lex-tr\">to have pity on, show mercy to</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ὁ δ' ἐρύσατο καί μ' ἐλέησεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.279</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σύ μ' ἐλέησον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">501</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eub.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐλέησον αὐτῶν τὴν ὄπα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pax</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">400</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. [τινα] ἐπὶ τοῖς ἀκουσίοις παθήμασι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.27</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τῆς τύχης τινά</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <s